<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - March 19.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - March 19.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto (0655 GMT) on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The latest index was 3721.42, 73.75 points or 1.94 percent lower than Tuesday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
